!!id:"https://tson.io/test-suite/class2/schema/invalid/a-namespace-type-leaving-a-facet-open-expected.tn"
!!import:"https://tson.io/test-suite/schemas/schema-sidecar.tn"
{
  spec: "[TSON-SCHEMA] §4.1, [TSON-SCHEMA] §7.2"
  description: """
    A namespace type is an instance of the kernel's `namespace`, and a value of it is a map from its `key_type` to
    its `value_type`. `value_type` is a required field of `namespace`, and `keyed` leaves it out, so the
    construction is refused: it describes no map. `key_type` may be left out, the host of a value supplying the
    family, as a record's fields are keyed by its `name_type`.
    """
  error: {
    category: resolver
  }
}
